Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.58,0:00:30.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Euchate and Thank
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.20,0:00:37.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.68,0:01:37.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I certainly had my hands full\Nlooking for that elusive eighth
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.02,0:01:41.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,child and at the same time trying\Nto hide Tentomon from my parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.56,0:01:46.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For some unexplained reason, there was a\Nstrange Digify signal moving all over town.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.30,0:01:49.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It confused everybody,\Nincluding DemiDevimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.84,0:01:54.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, Kabuterimon really got a nose\Nfull when he went up against Raremon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.32,0:01:58.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a very odorous Digimon with a body\Nstructure unlike any I've ever seen before.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.92,0:02:01.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But ultimately, he was\Nno match for Kabuterimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.20,0:02:07.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Most curious, with all this excitement,\Nyou'd think we were back in the Digi-World.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.56,0:02:14.98,Sign,,0,0,350,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\3c&H000000&}{\fad(300,0)\fs30\b1}Tokyo Tower is Hot! DeathMeramon
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.58,0:02:10.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Tokyo Tower!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.44,0:02:12.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,S. Melanmon!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.22,0:03:06.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.54,0:03:13.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hate this fog!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.70,0:03:16.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Master, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.74,0:03:18.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm getting mildew on my wings!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.50,0:03:21.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aha! Finally!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.48,0:03:25.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sheesh, you couldn't take\Na cab like everyone else?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.62,0:03:34.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At last, I was starting to worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.10,0:03:36.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.22,0:03:39.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I went out to have a bite to eat\Nand to get familiar with the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.72,0:03:43.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is always so difficult to get a\Ngood meal when one is away from home.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.94,0:03:44.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.85,0:03:46.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what do we do next, boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.26,0:03:48.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are continuing the\Nsearch for the Eighth Child.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.76,0:03:51.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The details are of no concern to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.32,0:03:54.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, as I always say,\Nuh, whatever you say!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.88,0:04:11.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.48,0:04:13.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where did I put that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.18,0:04:16.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Junk.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.28,0:04:17.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.28,0:04:19.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,More junk. More stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.48,0:04:21.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, I was a messy kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.38,0:04:23.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe how unorganized I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.92,0:04:29.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.38,0:04:31.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looking for my old phone book.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.34,0:04:33.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll have exactly what I need.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.16,0:04:34.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'm helping.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.34,0:04:37.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How come?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.54,0:04:39.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now, today's top story.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.28,0:04:41.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The monsters that are plaguing the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.24,0:04:42.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Still no official comment on where the
Dialogue: 1,0:04:41.55,0:04:46.59,Sign,,200,0,335,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\fs13}A Mysterious Animal \Nin Shiba-ura?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.94,0:04:45.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,creatures are from or\Nwhat they might be after.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.58,0:04:49.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We will keep you updated\Nthroughout the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.62,0:04:51.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, in other news,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.30,0:04:53.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,health officials report\Nyoung women all over
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.30,0:04:55.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the city are being\Nhospitalized for anemia.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.04,0:04:56.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.95,0:04:58.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No word on whether the\Ncases are connected.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.30,0:05:01.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But doctors are voicing\Nconcern that so many seemingly
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.14,0:05:04.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,healthy young women are being\Nstruck down so suddenly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.18,0:05:05.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai, it's your friend Izzy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.30,0:05:07.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.58,0:05:18.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey! Hey! Ready to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.02,0:05:20.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Agumon, you digivolved.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.42,0:05:21.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bet I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.42,0:05:23.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I needed was a good meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.42,0:05:24.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Psst!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.33,0:05:25.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's me, Tentomon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.82,0:05:27.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice disguise, dude. Thanks, Tai.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.10,0:05:29.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I put it together myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.78,0:05:31.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait till Mimi sees you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.28,0:05:32.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need one, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.18,0:05:34.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.09,0:05:34.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Any ideas?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.01,0:05:35.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.28,0:05:37.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.38,0:05:38.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Charlie, over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.86,0:05:40.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.20,0:05:44.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, real inconspicuous.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.48,0:05:50.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, Tai, did you find your\Naddress book from school?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.78,0:05:55.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, uh, well, Sora was in my class,\Nso I thought we'd just use hers.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.10,0:05:56.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.01,0:05:57.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Couldn't find it, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.92,0:06:02.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, listen up, everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.52,0:06:06.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I called you all here today because,\Nwell, there was nothing good on TV.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.38,0:06:08.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha-ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.29,0:06:09.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very funny, Tai.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.21,0:06:10.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So where are the others?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.32,0:06:11.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.23,0:06:12.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't start without me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.44,0:06:14.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.52,0:06:16.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, so where's Mimi?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.32,0:06:18.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's probably out buying clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.00,0:06:20.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, get out and walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.22,0:06:21.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're too heavy to push.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.66,0:06:22.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mimi, how's that going to look?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.98,0:06:24.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm supposed to be a little baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.92,0:06:25.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just grew up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.98,0:06:26.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.18,0:06:28.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, did you guys see it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.38,0:06:31.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was all over the\Nnews on TV this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.84,0:06:35.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,More and more of Myotismon's\NDigibozos are popping up in the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.72,0:06:38.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And they're very real. What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.40,0:06:42.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The last time we came back, there were\NDigimon all over the place, like now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.36,0:06:44.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But only Kari and I could see them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.68,0:06:49.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everybody else walked right by\Nthem, as if they weren't even there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.34,0:06:54.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now even normal people see them, and\Nthey're on the news and everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.68,0:06:57.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like they're really here this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.24,0:07:00.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's because this time they came\Nthrough the gate that Myotismon made.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.66,0:07:01.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.98,0:07:05.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If they can be seen, then they're physically\Nhere, and if they're here physically,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.70,0:07:07.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they can do a whole lot of damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.06,0:07:09.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, like what?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.32,0:07:13.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do I really need to remind you what\Nthose evil Digimon are capable of?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.92,0:07:14.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Creepy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.20,0:07:16.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Complete systems failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.14,0:07:18.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what are we sitting around here for?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.90,0:07:22.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We better get out there and find that\Neighth kid if we want to stop these guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.26,0:07:24.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Save the Digi-World\Nand we'll save our own!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.60,0:07:27.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go, Tai! Uh-huh. What's the plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.76,0:07:29.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I've got a few.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.16,0:07:32.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to hear Izzy's theory.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.78,0:07:34.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't start until I get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.10,0:07:35.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love Izzy's theories.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.14,0:07:35.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.05,0:07:38.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, we won't start without you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.52,0:07:41.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've already concluded that when\Nthe Digimon attacked four years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.94,0:07:44.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all of us, including the\NEighth Child, were there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.18,0:07:49.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is also safe to assume that each of\Nus were given Digivices for a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.46,0:07:53.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Last night, I picked up an\Nunidentified Digivice reading.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.88,0:07:55.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think it was the Eighth Child.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.12,0:07:57.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Obviously, I lost a signal,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.54,0:08:00.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it's clear that the Eighth\NChild is in this vicinity.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.32,0:08:02.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why the monsters are here, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.50,0:08:04.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Monsters worse than snakes.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:04.08,0:08:06.67,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\fad(300,0)}Wakaba Preschool
Dialogue: 1,0:08:04.08,0:08:06.67,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\fad(300,0)}Phone Book
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.42,0:08:07.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And this is supposed to help us? I'm lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.08,0:08:10.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My conclusion is that the Eighth Child is\Nsomewhere in one of these address books.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.58,0:08:11.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somehow,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.49,0:08:12.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we have to make a lot of calls and patrol
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.76,0:08:15.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the city for monster\Nattacks at the same time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.26,0:08:18.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess I could do some calling,\Nas long as my folks don't find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.92,0:08:20.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I really got to do\Nsome serious studying,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.88,0:08:23.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I won't be able to go\Non the search with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.28,0:08:24.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.19,0:08:25.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joe, it's summer.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.11,0:08:29.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm getting an early start This year\NI'm really gonna be prepared Here then
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.36,0:08:32.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're not coming with us Then you\Nmight as well do my calling for me Okay,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.00,0:08:34.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,thanks Joe,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.22,0:08:36.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we're talking about the fate of\Nthe world here If you're gonna
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.40,0:08:40.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,chicken out You can call all the\Nnames in my book too See ya Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.16,0:08:42.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it might make more sense Having\None person concentrate on all the
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.92,0:08:46.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,phone calling Rather than split it\Nup He has a point there Good luck
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.92,0:08:48.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.36,0:08:52.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, Tai Not yours too, please\NI'm not that kind of guy,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.74,0:08:56.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joe Don't worry, it's my job and\Nyou've got enough on your plate.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.14,0:08:59.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, man, Tai, you're a totally\Ngreat guy. Thanks a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.86,0:09:00.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.32,0:09:02.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.23,0:09:04.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Generous, I bet he couldn't\Nfind his address book.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.34,0:09:05.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, how'd you ever guess?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.70,0:09:10.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, look at all that damage\Nfrom last night's battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.72,0:09:13.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And there'll be a lot\Nmore, too, if this goes on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.20,0:09:15.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got to hurry up and\Nfind that eighth child.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.74,0:09:16.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We will.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.65,0:09:19.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're not called the\NDigidestined for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.56,0:09:23.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Master, are we almost there yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.12,0:09:25.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because all this water is making me crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.00,0:09:31.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those Digidestined brats are\Nprobably miles away by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.92,0:09:44.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.04,0:09:46.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That fog's coming in again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.66,0:09:48.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never seen anything like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.58,0:09:51.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At the same time, we're having\Nthe hottest weather on record.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.32,0:09:54.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I heard that somebody\Nsaw snow falling last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.78,0:09:58.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The ozone layer must be messed\Nup worse than we thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.64,0:10:05.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Welcome, O Great One.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.18,0:10:07.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All is ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.08,0:10:10.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perfect, Gatomon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.58,0:10:12.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As always, you have done excellent work.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.24,0:10:19.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Whiskers, what do\Nyou think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.34,0:10:21.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think I know why I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.84,0:10:23.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm finding the eighth child.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.46,0:10:24.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's my job, furball.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.28,0:10:27.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm in charge here. Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.52,0:10:28.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen up, puss in boots.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.76,0:10:30.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quit sucking up to the master.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.68,0:10:33.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the master's cute little pet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.74,0:10:35.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get me with a furball.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.54,0:10:39.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's really hard to feel threatened\Nby a bowling ball with feathers.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.20,0:10:40.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just keep out of my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.60,0:10:42.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm finding that kid, not you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.54,0:10:43.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.45,0:10:45.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take a catnap, kitty litter.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.68,0:10:51.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That flappy-winged Joker couldn't\Nfind water if he fell out of a boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.84,0:11:15.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, so we'll split up into pairs\Nso we can cover more of the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.08,0:11:17.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got it? Got it. Let's\Ngo. Good luck, everybody.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:18.44,0:11:24.41,Sign,,0,180,0,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Ice
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.82,0:11:22.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see food.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.44,0:11:25.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Agumon, keep your mind\Non our mission, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.24,0:11:28.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.15,0:11:29.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't catch me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.40,0:11:30.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.92,0:11:32.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you got it, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.24,0:11:36.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, there's nothing yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.66,0:11:41.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aw, it doesn't look like he's down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.94,0:11:44.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That would have been too\Neasy anyway. Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.62,0:11:49.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.53,0:11:52.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know this is kind of strange,\Nbut I was in second grade with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.06,0:11:54.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, stop pushing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.42,0:11:55.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am not pushing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.52,0:11:56.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're kicking me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.66,0:11:59.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You crossed the line onto\Nmy side, you big cheater.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.20,0:12:00.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am not a cheater.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.36,0:12:01.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.68,0:12:02.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm telling...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.59,0:12:03.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Knock it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.51,0:12:05.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you two keep fooling around,\Nsomeone's going to get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.64,0:12:06.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know how they feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.16,0:12:10.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just walking around in this heat's\Nenough to make anybody cranky.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.10,0:12:12.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know what this is, Sora?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.90,0:12:14.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A big fat drag.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.94,0:12:19.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What silly creatures.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.26,0:12:22.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pea-brained dolts, laugh it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.68,0:12:25.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When my Myotismon is through,\Nyou won't be laughing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.74,0:12:27.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miko, come back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.66,0:12:28.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where'd you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.16,0:12:29.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meeko!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.32,0:12:36.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a funny-looking kitty.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.66,0:12:41.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.74,0:12:42.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you a friend of Agumon?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.02,0:12:43.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.93,0:12:45.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you one of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.86,0:12:48.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.14,0:12:53.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, don't go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.04,0:13:01.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, she knows about Agumon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.50,0:13:05.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it possible this little\Nsquirt is the eighth child?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.44,0:13:17.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I know you're there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.64,0:13:22.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can come in if you\Nwant to. Mom's not home.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.50,0:13:30.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Weather experts can't explain\Nthe unseasonable fog. In fact,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.30,0:13:31.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they have no explanation for any of the
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.98,0:13:33.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,bizarre weather conditions\Nwe've been having,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.86,0:13:35.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,including this heat wave.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.50,0:13:37.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not meant for this kind of work.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.64,0:13:39.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I ever have a baby,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.30,0:13:43.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to hire somebody to\Npush her around, that's for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.12,0:13:43.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.12,0:13:45.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about a break, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.24,0:13:47.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Again?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.15,0:13:48.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll make it quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.66,0:13:53.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Last night, I got to sleep\Nin a soft bed with the A .C.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.62,0:13:55.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,cranked up, watching my own TV.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.72,0:13:57.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wasn't that the best, Belmont?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.16,0:13:58.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dinner was really something, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.06,0:14:00.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wasn't it great?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.24,0:14:03.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My mom knows all the best\Ntake-out places in the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.30,0:14:04.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She never has to cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.64,0:14:07.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zara's mom made our dinner,\Nand it was terrific.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.36,0:14:10.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, all of it except for this\Nkind of green, mushy stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.60,0:14:11.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's it called?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.08,0:14:12.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.94,0:14:14.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spinach.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.85,0:14:16.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, let's see. Where was I?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.26,0:14:20.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.60,0:14:22.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you look at that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.90,0:14:24.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's not even tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.32,0:14:25.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're different.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.23,0:14:26.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You like to take things easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.34,0:14:30.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Finding this kid's harder\Nthan finding a good sail.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.04,0:14:33.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sora, if we really\Nwant to find this kid,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.66,0:14:35.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we should go where lots of people gather.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.42,0:14:37.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You thinking of any place in particular?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.62,0:14:39.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep, right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.64,0:14:44.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, we can see the\Nwhole city from up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.10,0:14:46.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really get the lay of the land, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.68,0:15:03.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, look how high it goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.36,0:15:17.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ah there isn't that better nice and cool\Ni knew this place would have ac feels
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.04,0:15:24.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,great should have guessed you had an\Nulterior motive isn't your house over there
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.88,0:15:30.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,yeah it sure is strange being\Nback in our own world again
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.22,0:15:36.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,does it feel like it's getting warmer yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.96,0:15:39.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it does let's move over\Ncloser to the blower
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.32,0:15:42.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There, that's more like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.90,0:15:43.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.04,0:15:47.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened to the air?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.08,0:15:54.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe this heat wave finally\Ngot to be too much for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.78,0:15:57.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at that weirdo wearing\Na coat in this heat.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.70,0:15:59.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And such an ugly one, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.72,0:16:01.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mimi, be quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.10,0:16:01.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.01,0:16:03.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, and what's he gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.94,0:16:06.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See? He heard you. I told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.44,0:16:11.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.46,0:16:16.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess that explains the code.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.84,0:16:25.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it me or did it just\Nget hotter all of a sudden?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.66,0:16:26.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.42,0:16:28.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look up at the tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.62,0:16:30.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's almost like it's bending.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.36,0:16:31.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.22,0:16:35.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.52,0:16:43.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, we got trouble
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.36,0:17:02.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get ready for my needle spray!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.18,0:17:10.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha-ha-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.09,0:17:12.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha-ha-ha-ha-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.84,0:17:19.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Explain this to us, Abuman.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.64,0:17:20.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just who is this guy?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:20.68,0:17:26.69,Sign,,0,0,110,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\b1}DeathMeramon{\b0}
Dialogue: 1,0:17:20.68,0:17:26.69,Sign,,380,0,135,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Perfect
Dialogue: 1,0:17:20.68,0:17:26.69,Sign,,380,0,175,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Data
Dialogue: 1,0:17:20.68,0:17:26.69,Sign,,380,0,220,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Flame Digimon
Dialogue: 1,0:17:20.68,0:17:26.69,Sign,,380,0,310,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Special Attack
Dialogue: 1,0:17:20.68,0:17:26.69,Sign,,380,0,348,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Heavy Metal Fire
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.08,0:17:22.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's SkullMeramon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.52,0:17:23.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His element is fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.98,0:17:26.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's tough and he can sure dish it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.32,0:17:31.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Metal Fireball!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.36,0:17:36.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The tower's gonna fall on the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.88,0:17:38.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Grab it, Kabuterimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.40,0:17:39.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.76,0:17:45.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ghosts, you know not to play\Nwith fire. Are you ready? Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.80,0:17:48.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Agumon, Stinger Balls, Tommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.88,0:17:50.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Raymond!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.58,0:18:03.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great, now we really made him mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.02,0:18:07.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He swallowed that Nova Blast\Nlike a hot fudge sundae.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.32,0:18:09.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All it did was make him stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.18,0:18:11.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unless Greymon Digivolves\Nagain, he's toast!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.54,0:18:14.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah! Ah! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.36,0:18:25.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No monsters! Digimon! Digimon!\NDigimon! No monsters! Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.72,0:18:26.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.26,0:18:29.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Greymon! Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.18,0:18:31.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.98,0:18:33.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,MetalGreymon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.18,0:18:35.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.09,0:18:39.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Little monsters digimon,\Nyou're the champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.78,0:18:42.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kijiman, Kijiroma,\Nsuzuchiman, you're the king!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.08,0:18:47.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kijiman, suzuchiman!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.02,0:19:05.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lights be jemmy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.04,0:19:07.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.30,0:19:09.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This guy is scary! Hi, hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.76,0:19:11.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Metal fireball!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.22,0:19:18.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, up here, bucket of bolts! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.28,0:19:20.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Megaclaw!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.68,0:19:28.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.76,0:19:32.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Metal fireball!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.16,0:19:36.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's got who now?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.00,0:19:37.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.68,0:19:50.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,GIGABLASTER!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.50,0:20:03.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,While the clash of the monsters\Ncaused extensive damage to the tower,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.08,0:20:03.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,no casualties...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.99,0:20:05.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She isn't so bad for a human.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.04,0:20:09.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Better company than some\NDigimon, that's for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.46,0:20:13.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But fear is in the air, and there's\Na general feeling of public unrest.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.42,0:20:15.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now back to our regular programming.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.42,0:20:16.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Still,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.33,0:20:17.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,orders are orders,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.25,0:20:20.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I'm not going to be the one\Nwho lets the eighth child get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.92,0:20:22.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.20,0:20:24.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh... Come here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.12,0:20:25.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.46,0:20:30.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you going already?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.86,0:20:35.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you'll come back again, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.38,0:20:42.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her sweetness makes me lose\Nmy edge, but I'll be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.80,0:20:44.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and next time I'll be ready for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.68,0:20:47.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,While no one knows where these\Nmonsters are from or why they're here,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.96,0:20:50.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's clear the Earth is at\Nsome sort of crossroads.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.10,0:20:53.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The question is, down which\Nroad does our destiny await?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.30,0:22:17.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,La La
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.84,0:22:22.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,la La
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.54,0:22:24.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,La La La La La.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.56,0:22:44.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was looking for it, and he\Nwas worried about it, and Takeru.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.58,0:22:48.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Pumptu and Gotsu were led\Nto the game to play with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.14,0:22:51.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.05,0:22:54.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will the Digimon will\Nhappen in this country?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.72,0:22:56.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next time on Digimon Adventure!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:58.27,0:23:01.10,Sign,,0,0,300,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\3c&H000000&}{\fs30\b1}Pump and Gotsu are Shibuya-type Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.50,0:23:01.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure what's going on now.

